     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Observation SpecularMicroscopyRightEyeExample</b></p><a name=\"SpecularMicroscopyRightEyeExample\"> </a><a name=\"hcSpecularMicroscopyRightEyeExample\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-specular-microscopy.html\">Ophthalmic Specular Microscopy</a></p></div><p><b>status</b>: Final</p><p><b>category</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/observation-category exam}\">Exam</span></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CodeSystem/fhir4eyes-cs specular-microscopy-panel}\">Corneal endothelial specular microscopy</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Patient-PatientExample.html\">Patient Example  Female, DoB: 1990-01-01 ( Passport number: PA1234567)</a></p><p><b>effective</b>: 2026-08-18 09:00:00+0000</p><p><b>performer</b>: <a href=\"Practitioner-OphthalmologistExample.html\">Practitioner Ophthalmologist Example </a></p><p><b>note</b>: </p><blockquote><div><p>Example based on typical Topcon SP-1P specular microscopy report</p>\n</div></blockquote><p><b>bodySite</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\"></span></p><p><b>method</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Automated</span></p><p><b>device</b>: Topcon SP-1P</p><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CodeSystem/fhir4eyes-cs endothelial-cell-density}, {http://loinc.org 100070-2}\">Endothelial cell density (CD)</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 2456 /mm2<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  code/mm2 = '/mm2')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CodeSystem/fhir4eyes-cs specular-capture-position}\">Capture position</span></p><p><b>value</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Central</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CodeSystem/fhir4eyes-cs endothelial-cells-counted}, {http://loinc.org 100076-9}\">Number of cells analyzed (N)</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 98 1<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  code1 = '1')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CodeSystem/fhir4eyes-cs endothelial-cell-area-cv}, {http://loinc.org 100072-8}\">Coefficient of variation (CV)</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 32 %<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  code% = '%')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CodeSystem/fhir4eyes-cs endothelial-hexagonality}, {http://loinc.org 100074-4}\">Hexagonality (HEX)</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 58 %<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  code% = '%')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CodeSystem/fhir4eyes-cs central-corneal-thickness}, {http://loinc.org 79825-6}\">Central corneal thickness (CCT)</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 542 um<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codeum = 'um')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CodeSystem/fhir4eyes-cs endothelial-cell-area-min}, {http://loinc.org 100078-5}\">Minimum cell area (MIN)</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 218 um2<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codeum2 = 'um2')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://Yasni